# Forage – Virtual Job Simulations

## Overview

I completed three virtual job simulations through Forage in September 2026. The activities introduced me to workplace scenarios involving project coordination, facilities management and IT service support.

These were self-paced educational simulations, not employment, internships, company-delivered training placements or professional qualifications.

